@page "/security"

<PageTitle>Security</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-card">
        <h1 class="legal-title">Security & Protection</h1>
        <p class="legal-subtitle">How we protect your financial data</p>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>1. Data Encryption</h2>
            <p>All data communication between your browser and the Aumo Finance server is protected by industry-standard SSL/TLS encryption.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>2. Protected Authentication</h2>
            <p>The session and user credential management system is handled using a secure authentication architecture to prevent unauthorized access.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>3. Infrastructure Security</h2>
            <p>We periodically update system dependencies and conduct internal audits to keep the platform resilient against cybersecurity threats.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
